<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Klipton in talks, issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>Klipton in talks, issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Klipton Ltd on Monday issued a cautionary announcment to shareholders and convertible debenture holders, saying that negotiations were in progress which, if successful, could impact on the price of Klipton's equity instruments.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
